","type":"sentencePool","options":{"A":"第几页有那张图？","B":"你怎么没来跑步？","C":"打完这场球，咱们去哪儿？","D":"你怎么每天用完电脑还要看书？","E":"下午谁替我给老师还书？"}},"HSK3-C07-R-V1":{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-V1","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"清楚","B":"要求","C":"参加","D":"方便","E":"页","F":"提高"}},"HSK3-C07-R-V2":{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-V2","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"练习","B":"场","C":"遍","D":"复习","E":"难","F":"还"}},"HSK3-C07-R-T57":{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-T57","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"新学期开始后，小米觉得外语比去年难了。她先每天晚上读一课，但到了第二天就忘了很多。朋友建议她早上再读一小段，晚上把不明白的地方写下来。一个星期以后，她发现自己上课能听懂更多了，也能和同桌一起练对话了。"},"HSK3-C07-R-T59":{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-T59","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"学校星期五下午有一场网球比赛，小江原来答应一起参加。上午体育老师告诉他，第一场提前到午饭以前。小江这时还在上数学课，就请同学先打第一场。吃过午饭以后，他赶到球场，发现同学刚打完，正好赶上了下午的比赛。"}},"examples":{"EM":{"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M1","prompt":"老师，怎么才能参加运动会？","answer":"C"},"EV1":{"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V1","prompt":"图书馆离教室很近，借书很（　）。","answer":"D"},"EV2":{"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V2","prompt":"甲：昨天借你的书，我用完了。／乙：明天上课前（　）给我就行。","answer":"F"},"E3":{"passage":"周二小张借了我的笔记，说星期三还。后来发现星期三没课，他提前把本子交给了我的同桌。","question":"小张把笔记交给谁了？","options":{"A":"老师","B":"小张的妈妈","C":"我的同桌"},"answer":"C"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-31","number":31,"lesson":10,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M1","prompt":"今天的数学作业你觉得怎么样？","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-32","number":32,"lesson":9,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M1","prompt":"这场网球比赛你会参加吗？","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-33","number":33,"lesson":10,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M1","prompt":"黑板上那些字太小了，我看不清。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-34","number":34,"lesson":10,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M1","prompt":"我昨天借给你的书在哪儿？","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-35","number":35,"lesson":10,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M1","prompt":"老师刚才说的都记下来了吗？","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-36","number":36,"lesson":10,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M2","prompt":"第十八页，下面有一张大的。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-37","number":37,"lesson":9,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M2","prompt":"先去体育馆门口等小李吧。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-38","number":38,"lesson":10,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M2","prompt":"小方去，他也要去老师办公室。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-39","number":39,"lesson":10,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M2","prompt":"我想复习一会儿明天要考的内容。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-40","number":40,"lesson":9,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-M2","prompt":"我今天早上没带运动鞋，就没去。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-41","number":41,"lesson":9,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V1","prompt":"下个月的运动会我也想（　）。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-42","number":42,"lesson":10,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V1","prompt":"老师刚才说得太快，我没听（　）。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-43","number":43,"lesson":10,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V1","prompt":"我把生词记在本子的第二（　）上。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-44","number":44,"lesson":10,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V1","prompt":"老师（　）每个人把作业再读一遍。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-45","number":45,"lesson":10,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V1","prompt":"每天多听别人说中文，听力会慢慢（　）。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-46","number":46,"lesson":10,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V2","prompt":"甲：你觉得这道题（　）吗？／乙：我觉得不容易，做了两次才做出来。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-47","number":47,"lesson":9,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V2","prompt":"甲：周末学校有几（　）比赛？／乙：上午一场，下午还有两场。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-48","number":48,"lesson":10,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V2","prompt":"甲：老师让我们把对话读几（　）？／乙：先读两次，记不住的再多读一次。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-49","number":49,"lesson":10,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V2","prompt":"甲：考试以前你怎么（　）历史？／乙：我先把这个星期的笔记看看。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-50","number":50,"lesson":9,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-V2","prompt":"甲：明天打网球，今天还要（　）吗？／乙：要，我打算下课以后再打一小时。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-51","number":51,"lesson":10,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"昨天老师在黑板上写了五句话。小安只来得及记下三句。下课后，朋友把后面两句拍给她，她才把笔记补全了。","question":"朋友发给小安什么？","options":{"A":"没记下的两句话","B":"黑板上的五句话","C":"自己的作业"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-52","number":52,"lesson":9,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"为了参加下周的网球比赛，小林每天放学后都去球场练。今天下雨，他不能在外面打，就和朋友去了体育馆。","question":"小林今天在哪里练球？","options":{"A":"体育馆","B":"球场","C":"家里"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-53","number":53,"lesson":10,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"小何原来写完作业就把本子放回书包。最近老师让大家写完以后再检查一次。他发现这样常能找出一两处写错的地方。","question":"小何最近写完作业后多做什么？","options":{"A":"把本子交给老师","B":"抄一遍课本","C":"检查一次"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-54","number":54,"lesson":9,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"学校的运动会有很多项目，小方打算参加跑步和打篮球。比赛那天她到得有点儿晚，跑步已经结束了，最后只参加了篮球比赛。","question":"小方实际参加了什么？","options":{"A":"跑步","B":"篮球比赛","C":"两项都参加了"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-55","number":55,"lesson":10,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"小周每天读中文书，遇到不懂的句子就用笔画下来。第二天他带书去学校，下课后找老师问，比自己一直想快多了。","question":"小周会请谁帮他弄懂句子？","options":{"A":"老师","B":"朋友","C":"同桌"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-56","number":56,"lesson":9,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"我的球拍坏了，想借小文的用一天。他下午有比赛，要先用自己的球拍，就说等他比赛结束了，再把球拍借给我。","question":"小文什么时候能借出球拍？","options":{"A":"下午到学校时","B":"比赛结束以后","C":"比赛以前"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-57","number":57,"lesson":10,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-T57","question":"小米开始用什么方法学习？","options":{"A":"每天晚上读一课","B":"和同桌一起练对话","C":"把问题告诉老师"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-58","number":58,"lesson":10,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-T57","question":"一个星期以后，小米有什么变化？","options":{"A":"不再看课本","B":"忘得更多了","C":"上课能听懂更多"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-59","number":59,"lesson":9,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-T59","question":"小江为什么没打第一场？","options":{"A":"他没有球拍","B":"他还在上课","C":"他不想打网球"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-R-60","number":60,"lesson":9,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C07-R-T59","question":"小江什么时候到了球场？","options":{"A":"数学课以前","B":"上午上课时","C":"午饭以后"},"answer":"C"}]},"writing":{"examples":{"pinyinCharacter":{"prompt":"请把你的东西（　）在这儿。","pinyin":"fàng","answer":"放"},"pictureSentence":{"word":"看书","image":"assets/images/w-example.jpg","answer":"小男孩正在看书。"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-61","number":61,"lesson":10,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"请把老师写在黑（　）上的句子记下来。","pinyin":"bǎn","answer":"板","reference":"请把老师写在黑板上的句子记下来。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-62","number":62,"lesson":10,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"我只剩最后一（　）没看完了。","pinyin":"yè","answer":"页","reference":"我只剩最后一页没看完了。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-63","number":63,"lesson":9,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"为了参加比赛，他每天下午都（　）一会儿网球。","pinyin":"liàn","answer":"练","reference":"为了参加比赛，他每天下午都练一会儿网球。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-64","number":64,"lesson":10,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"上课以前，请先读读最后那两（　）话。","pinyin":"jù","answer":"句","reference":"上课以前，请先读读最后那两句话。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-65","number":65,"lesson":9,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"他想（　）加运动会，但还没有决定比什么。","pinyin":"cān","answer":"参","reference":"他想参加运动会，但还没有决定比什么。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-66","number":66,"lesson":10,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"黑板","image":"assets/images/c07-w-66.jpg","reference":"老师在黑板上画图。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-67","number":67,"lesson":10,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"笔记","image":"assets/images/c07-w-67.jpg","reference":"他们在一起看上课时记的笔记。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-68","number":68,"lesson":9,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"网球","image":"assets/images/c07-w-68.jpg","reference":"她正在打网球。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-69","number":69,"lesson":10,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"复习","image":"assets/images/c07-w-69.jpg","reference":"他在家用课本和笔记复习。"},{"id":"HSK3-C07-W-70","number":70,"lesson":9,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"比赛","image":"assets/images/c07-w-70.jpg","reference":"两个学生正在进行乒乓球比赛。"}]},"title":"第2次课 · 校园和学习方法","writingRubric":{"2":"使用指定词，句意完整，内容与图片相符。意思正确的其他句子也可得分。","1":"使用指定词，能看出主要图意，语序、用词或搭配有明显错误。","0":"空白、遗漏指定词、句意无法判断，或内容与图片不符。"}}
